<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Profile gift bubbles pulse, orbit faster, and light up in time with profile music. Flicks now use the speed of the release.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Business Hours expands and collapses without leaving a gap in Profile Details. Mapped locations and action buttons use the profile card styling.&lt;br&gt;• Private Notes follows the profile palette, and empty personal channels finish loading.&lt;br&gt;• In community chats, the Back button sits beside Search.&lt;br&gt;</description>
